{"4755460": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SavingSanta", "steam_appid": 4755460, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a VR player, you start the game at the beginning of level 1, and must navigate accross a field or traps to get to the end of the map, reaching the Huge Cup at the end. This takes you to level 2 and 3, until you reach the end and save Santa. Christmas is threatened, so you have traveled to the North Pole where you must navigate an insane number of traps as you are forced forward, jumping, and ducking in VR (Virtual Reality) trying to get through the levels to the end to free an imprisoned Santa! You know the dangers, now live to tell the tell and help save the world from those that are out to destroy cheer!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply put this is a VR Runner, you are pushed forward, and must not fall in the water! You can collect coins, rings and starts for points. The game includes 3 levels, Left controller stick to move right or left and up on the right controller stick to jump up. You must naivate all the obstacles to survive. Show us if you've got what it takes.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a VR player, you start the game at the beginning of level 1, and must navigate accross a field or traps to get to the end of the map, reaching the Huge Cup at the end. This takes you to level 2 and 3, until you reach the end and save Santa. Christmas is threatened, so you have traveled to the North Pole where you must navigate an insane number of traps as you are forced forward, jumping, and ducking in VR (Virtual Reality) trying to get through the levels to the end to free an imprisoned Santa! You know the dangers, now live to tell the tell and help save the world from those that are out to destroy cheer!<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply put this is a VR Runner, you are pushed forward, and must not fal